             font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">Congratulations brides from\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/www.thatmomentphoto.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>That Moment Photo<\/a>\u00a0team!<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">We gladly invite you to check more of our\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/www.thatmomentphoto.com\/index.php\/blog' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>latest works<\/a>\u00a0Hope you enjoy them as much as we do!<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Feel free to contact us for more info! You can select or make your own package! We also assist you with the fee\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<\/span> <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#808080;\">That Moment Photo Team<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#808080;\">Photo and Video Wedding Service<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#808080;\">info@thatmomentphoto.com<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#808080;\">Phone: (+52)1 9841080445<\/span><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.thatmomentphoto.com\/'><span style=\"color:#ff8c00;\">www.thatmomentphoto.com<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"info@tha