lse,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":18414,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8415a635b1a247a6c2038c6846691fd4","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Since there are a few of us booked now and hopefully more to come I thought it would be great to start our very own thread. Also it can be a good place to find info on booking a wedding there and hopefully we can be a resource to others.\n \n &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: normal; background-color: rgb(253, 252, 250);\"&gt;Azul Sensatori Wedding Links:&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;img alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" border=\"0\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" src=\"http:\/\/i273.photobucket.com\/albums\/jj223\/JHarwood2Be\/azv_overview_18.jpg\" \/&gt;\n &lt;img alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" border=\"0\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" src=\"http:\/\/i273.photobucket.com\/albums\/jj223\/JHarwood2Be\/azv_accomodations_08.jpg\" \/&gt;\n &lt;img alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" border=\"0\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" src=\"http:\/\/i273.photobucket.com\/albums\/jj223\/JHarwood2Be\/Honeymoon-Suite-Terrace.jpg\" \/&gt;\n \n Happy posting! &lt;img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/elefant.gif\" title=\"Elefant\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":347143,"PostDate":1213842696,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                